  "explanation": {
    "text": "Adding means putting numbers together to make a bigger number. Subtracting means taking a number away to make a smaller number. A number line helps us see this happen, one step at a time.",
    "example": "7 + 5 means starting at 7 and counting forward 5 more steps."
  },
